# Tango with a Tracker (battlefield.tango_with_a_tracker#reqs, Boneyard Gully): Three chars trigger the entry: main (no
# letter, not completed) and cat (completed the quest, no letter) get NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7102 (the framework's trigger
# refusal) and a release; bob (Letter from Shikaree X) gets event 32000.
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger
char zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
bob: keyitem LetterFromShikareeX
cat: quest OtherAreas.TangoWithATracker completed
login
bob: login
cat: login
trigger _081
bob: trigger _081
cat: trigger _081
